{"text":["Integrations","AutoGen","🤝","Frameworks","Use Hanzo AI with AutoGen","Build multi-agent systems with Microsoft AutoGen. Set base_url to api.hanzo.ai/v1 in the AutoGen config, name a Hanzo model, and the agents run on it.","Base URL:","https://api.hanzo.ai/v1","Get yours at","Fully OpenAI-compatible","400+ models","available","API Key:","platform.hanzo.ai/api-keys","Created by","Microsoft Research","License:","MIT","View source on GitHub →","Hanzo AI is OpenAI-compatible, so existing AutoGen code works with zero refactoring. We deeply appreciate the Microsoft Research team for building and maintaining this open-source project.","AutoGen setup","python","pip install pyautogen","import","autogen","config_list =","[{","model","zen4-pro","api_key","your-hanzo-api-key","base_url","}]","assistant = autogen","AssistantAgent","name=","assistant","llm_config=","config_list","},","user_proxy = autogen","UserProxyAgent","user_proxy","human_input_mode=","NEVER","initiate_chat","message=","Write a Python script to sort a list.","Multi-agent conversation","coder = autogen","coder","system_message=","You write clean Python code.","reviewer = autogen","reviewer","You review code for bugs.","groupchat = autogen","GroupChat","agents=","],","messages=","[])","manager = autogen","GroupChatManager","groupchat=groupchat","})","Code execution agent","code_execution_config=","work_dir","coding","use_docker","False","Environment setup","bash","export","HANZO_API_KEY=","# AutoGen picks up OAI_CONFIG_LIST or inline config","# No extra env vars needed — just point base_url to Hanzo","Ready to get started?","Create a free account and get your API key. The Free plan includes free model requests and Kai decisions, no card.","Get API key — Free","Browse Models","More integrations","OpenAI Python SDK","Anthropic SDK","LangChain","LlamaIndex","Vercel AI SDK","Hugging Face","CrewAI","DSPy","Haystack","Cursor","Continue.dev","GitHub Copilot","Docker","Kubernetes","Python","TypeScript","Go","Rust"],"links":["/integrations","https://platform.hanzo.ai/api-keys","https://microsoft.com/en-us/research","https://github.com/microsoft/autogen","/models","/integrations/openai-sdk","/integrations/anthropic-sdk","/integrations/langchain","/integrations/llamaindex","/integrations/vercel-ai-sdk","/integrations/huggingface","/integrations/crewai","/integrations/dspy","/integrations/haystack","/integrations/cursor","/integrations/continue-dev","/integrations/github-copilot","/integrations/docker","/integrations/kubernetes","/integrations/python","/integrations/typescript","/integrations/go","/integrations/rust"]}